# =============================================================================
# 🧩 ORCHESTRATOR APPLY - COMPOSE RESOURCE REGISTRATION
# =============================================================================
# The one place that turns a discovered service into Tilt resources, split by
# job: the dependsOn graph lives in dependency_graph.star, shared Postgres and
# golden-image stack decisions in stack_decisions.star, live update rules in
# live_update.star, image build and prebuild in image_build.star, the health /
# job / replica / typecheck companions in companion_resources.star, and the
# pytest-on-save resource in python_test_resource.star. This file keeps the
# orchestrator (register_compose_resources) and re-exports the public API:
# Starlark `load` does not re-export loaded names, so every public name the
# engine and its tests load here is bound to the function that moved.
# =============================================================================

# === INLINED CONSTANTS for pure extension loading ===
